{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dialogSuppressionToggle"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isSuppressed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI7BindingV","text":"Binding"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the suppression toggle is on or off"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the dialog."}]}],"name":"isSuppressed"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Applying dialog suppression adds a toggle to dialogs on Windows,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which allows the user to request the alert not be displayed again."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Typically whether a dialog is suppressed is stored in "},{"code":"AppStorage","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and used to decide whether to present the dialog in the future."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example configures an alert with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"suppression toggle. The toggle’s state is stored in "},{"code":"AppStorage","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used to determine whether or not to show the dialog when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“Delete Items” button is pressed."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["struct MyApp: App {","    @State private var isShowingDialog = false","    @AppStorage(\"suppressEraseItemAlert\")","    private var suppressAlert = false","","    var body: some Scene {","        Window(...) {","            Button(\"Delete items\") {","                isShowingDialog = true","            }","        }","","        AlertScene(","            \"Are you sure you want to erase these items?\",","            isPresented: $isShowingDialog","        ) {","            Button(\"Erase\", role: .destructive) {","                \/\/ Handle item deletion.","            }","            Button(\"Cancel\", role: .cancel) {","                \/\/ Handle cancellation","            }","        }","        .dialogSuppressionToggle(","            \"Do not ask about erasing items again\",","            isSuppressed: $suppressAlert)","    }","}"]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneModifier_Content"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneModifier_Content\/dialogSuppressionToggle(isSuppressed:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Enables user suppression of an alert with a custom suppression"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scenemodifier_content\/dialogsuppressiontoggle(issuppressed:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSw